      "side": 1,
      "message": "On load failure this returns the full `BUILT_IN_ACTIONS`, re-exposing actions a project disabled via tombstone (the `disabled` filter runs only on the success path). Refresh-before-send uses the same fallback, so it does not fail closed, and the fallback notice is prepended only after the patch fetch and model call. Fail closed instead: hide configured and built-in buttons on load failure, show the config error, and keep free-form prompting.",
