      "side": 1,
      "message": "When no provider is enabled (no API token), `getActions` returns empty and `getModels` throws, so a project\u0027s configured AI review actions are not shown at all until a token is set. This is reasonable — without a model an action button would just fail on click — but it also means the project admin\u0027s configured actions are invisible/undiscoverable until then. Consider surfacing their existence, e.g. the no-token notice mentioning that AI review actions become available once a token is added. Minor UX, not a correctness issue.",
